    },
    "body": "Process change companion to the ruleset: main is now protected (ruleset id 19597522) — no direct pushes, five CI checks required with strict up-to-date policy. AGENTS.md gains the per-issue flow: assign -> branch -> PR -> checks -> merge -> close with DoD evidence. The merge-queue rule type was rejected by the API twice (plan/instance limitation); if the Settings UI toggle gets enabled, PRs route through the merge queue with the same workflow. This PR is itself the first change through the new protected path.",
